      "qualityReason": "route_only"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1814, Tennessee troops joined Andrew Jackson’s force in the Creek Indian War, a conflict that opened Alabama to settlers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
